  "label": "Stereotype: Indigenous women are violent threats",
  "description": "This is a racist and misogynistic stereotype that portrays Indigenous women as inherently violent or dangerous, often used to justify their exclusion from public life or to portray them as threats to society. It is a false and harmful trope that ignores the reality of Indigenous women’s experiences and contributes to the erasure of their humanity.",
